WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:05.809
Everyone worries about the future now and
then, even members of the O5 Council, the

00:00:05.809 --> 00:00:09.470
most powerful figures in the SCP Foundation.

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:13.880
Civilians resort to keeping themselves in
blissful ignorance or relying on the calming

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:19.840
platitudes of horoscopes and fortune cookies,
but the O5 Council has access to considerably

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:23.170
more accurate methods of understanding the
future.

00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:28.870
That’s why, when O5-2 began to feel anxious
about the future of the human race, she took

00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:31.279
matters into her own hands.

00:00:31.279 --> 00:00:36.820
She’d already spent time using SCP-2003
- a device created by the Foundation to travel

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:42.179
briefly into the future - in hopes of seeing
what fate had in store for humanity.

00:00:42.179 --> 00:00:48.710
But very few of the futures shown by SCP-2003
were good ones for the human race, with many

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:52.620
showing various end of the world scenarios
playing out.

00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:59.639
So instead O5-2 decided to make her way to
Existential Isolation Facility Beta - an experimental

00:00:59.639 --> 00:01:05.480
facility that contains an entirely separate
reality - In order to get into contact with

00:01:05.480 --> 00:01:07.220
SCP-411.

00:01:07.220 --> 00:01:13.080
SCP-411 is a centuries-old man from the future
who ages in reverse.

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:18.720
Though his advanced age has rendered him somewhat
senile, useful facts about the future can

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:22.680
sometimes be noted from his scattered memories
of what is yet to come.

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:27.800
While getting him to part with this information
is a risky procedure - given that 411 is so

00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:33.420
old that even extended conversations might
kill him - in times of absolute emergency,

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:38.290
it’s sometimes the clearest look into the
future the Foundation has.

00:01:38.290 --> 00:01:44.900
O5-2 hoped that, in talking to SCP-411, she
could settle some of her anxieties regarding

00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:46.380
humanity’s future.

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:51.140
But the answers she got from the senile, bed-bound
Ancient Precognitive weren’t exactly what

00:01:51.140 --> 00:01:52.800
she was hoping for.

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:56.550
When she asked him whether there was a future
for humanity on earth he responded:

00:01:56.550 --> 00:01:58.500
“The Planet of Hands.

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:01.370
This is what we are to speak of.

00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:03.930
I am from there, you know.

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:05.440
As are you, child.

00:02:05.440 --> 00:02:07.900
You shall know more of it in time.

00:02:07.900 --> 00:02:11.790
I am glad to be here now instead.

00:02:11.790 --> 00:02:13.889
Greetings, prodigal daughter.

00:02:13.889 --> 00:02:17.099
Unlike me, you'll be home soon.”

00:02:17.099 --> 00:02:22.310
Unsatisfied, O5-2 left shortly after, her
anxiety undeterred.

00:02:22.310 --> 00:02:27.099
Little did she know, she had very good reasons
to be anxious about humanity’s future, and

00:02:27.099 --> 00:02:30.290
we’re not just talking about nuclear war
or climate change.

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:35.799
We’re talking about the threat nobody expects:
SCP-001.

00:02:35.799 --> 00:02:40.220
And this time, it isn’t the Black Moon,
or the Scarlet King, or the terrifying When

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:41.220
Day Breaks.

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:45.700
Today, we’re talking about...Well, we’ll
get to that in due time.

00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:49.060
It’d be a terrible shame to spoil the surprise.

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:53.269
And besides, there’s a lot of chaos and
horror to get through before then.

00:02:53.269 --> 00:02:58.310
The Foundation has always been vaguely aware
of SCP-001 and the terrible threat it poses

00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:03.019
towards all of humanity, but that doesn’t
necessarily mean they understand its true

00:03:03.019 --> 00:03:04.019
nature.

00:03:04.019 --> 00:03:08.489
Still, does it matter whether or not a deer
understands the hunter’s rifle?

00:03:08.489 --> 00:03:12.689
No - Only that it must avoid being found between
its crosshairs.

00:03:12.689 --> 00:03:19.900
And the Foundation’s method for staying
out of 001’s crosshairs was known as SCP-2798.

00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:24.981
This Thaumiel-Class anomaly was created by
the Foundation to specifically keep 001 away

00:03:24.981 --> 00:03:26.609
from all of us.

00:03:26.609 --> 00:03:31.719
Since the start of recorded history, strange
anomalous activity has been reported, causing

00:03:31.719 --> 00:03:34.689
suffering and distress against humans.

00:03:34.689 --> 00:03:39.309
This eventually led to the creation of The
SCP Foundation, which seemingly correlated

00:03:39.309 --> 00:03:43.669
with a massive spike in severe and dangerous
anomalous activity.

00:03:43.669 --> 00:03:50.279
All of this activity was believed to lead
back to SCP-001: An anomalous, hostile, and

00:03:50.279 --> 00:03:56.449
highly intelligent entity or series of entities
that wish to do humanity great harm.

00:03:56.449 --> 00:04:01.150
Rather than playing whack-a-mole with 001’s
anomalies, they hoped to deal with its threat

00:04:01.150 --> 00:04:06.349
more directly, leading to the creation of
SCP-2798.

00:04:06.349 --> 00:04:10.809
To go into too much detail would probably
derail the video entirely, but for us to give

00:04:10.809 --> 00:04:17.750
you a brief summary of what exactly SCP-2798
is: It’s comprised of 8000 melted human

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:22.620
souls as well as several SCPs being pumped
down into the earth’s mantle.

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:28.440
While this came with certain unpleasant side
effects, it also acted as a kind of cloaking

00:04:28.440 --> 00:04:34.500
device - By pumping so much life essence into
the earth, it made us all seem like one single

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:40.440
organism, thus keeping the watchful eyes of
SCP-001 away from all of us.

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:43.440
This initiative was given the codename Project
Serapis.

00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:48.350
Here’s the problem, though: Project Serapis
was never meant to be a permanent fix.

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:54.500
And what’s more, it’s actually been degrading
over the last several decades, until it finally,

00:04:54.500 --> 00:04:55.750
recently collapsed.

00:04:55.750 --> 00:05:02.090
Earth’s cloaking device had collapsed with
it, and now, the eyes of SCP-001 were starting

00:05:02.090 --> 00:05:05.030
to come into focus on our pale blue dot.

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:10.170
And just like O5-2 had feared, things were
about to get an awful lot worse.

00:05:10.170 --> 00:05:16.850
On November 2nd, 2016, 001 detected the population
of earth and began to work its terrifying

00:05:16.850 --> 00:05:17.850
magic.

00:05:17.850 --> 00:05:22.450
It began creating what is known as Altered
Phenomena out of pre-existing anomalies.

00:05:22.450 --> 00:05:27.900
Think of them almost as Super SCPs, almost
universally stronger and more dangerous than

00:05:27.900 --> 00:05:30.020
their original incarnations.

00:05:30.020 --> 00:05:35.860
If you thought the SCPs were dangerous before,
then these new ones are your worst nightmare.

00:05:35.860 --> 00:05:38.400
It didn’t take long for chaos to break out.

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:43.240
A huge number of the Foundation databases
across the globe experienced sudden collapses.

00:05:43.240 --> 00:05:48.490
The horrifying monster that SCP-058, the Heart
of Darkness, belonged to, began attacking

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:50.440
its containment area.

00:05:50.440 --> 00:05:54.870
Massive containment breaches occurred in a
huge number of sites, and soldiers and containment

00:05:54.870 --> 00:06:00.090
experts were dispatched in hopes of bringing
this rapidly escalating situation back under

00:06:00.090 --> 00:06:01.090
control.

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:06.100
Photos of SCP-439, the Bone Hive Earwigs,
were somehow leaked on Imgur.

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:10.650
Some constellations even began disappearing
all over the sky.

00:06:10.650 --> 00:06:14.500
SCP-1000s launched a violent coup and took
over Blalock, Oregon.

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:20.360
As the global 001 situations escalated and
anomalies began overwhelming different Foundation

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:25.430
strongholds, some sites were considered lost,
though employees were threatened with termination

00:06:25.430 --> 00:06:27.670
if they abandoned their posts.

00:06:27.670 --> 00:06:32.530
Some anomalies went entirely missing into
the civilian world and started causing chaos.

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:38.200
M. Al-Hamzi, one of the Foundation’s interfaith
liaisons from Armed Area-19, was quoted saying

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:43.300
“The day will come when this earth will
be substituted with a new earth, and also

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:48.720
the heavens, and everyone will be brought
before GOD, the One, the Supreme.

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:50.140
Allah preserve us.”

00:06:50.140 --> 00:06:54.560
You’re probably wondering: Given that an
army of enhanced SCPs were released to cause

00:06:54.560 --> 00:07:00.870
violence and chaos across the globe by SCP-001,
do we have any specific examples of some of

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:05.750
the anomalies made bigger, badder, and a hell
of a lot more dangerous by this mysterious

00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:06.750
foe?

00:07:06.750 --> 00:07:11.670
Don’t worry - The rest of this video is
going to be specific examples of exactly that.

00:07:11.670 --> 00:07:15.920
Take, for example, SCP-087, the Endless Stairwell.

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:20.870
This went from a localized entity at an undisclosed
university administrative building to an even

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:25.540
more dangerous stairwell in the Pentagon,
which had the ability to open and close its

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:30.200
doorway at will, presumably hoping to capture
some power players from the United States

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:32.040
Department of Defense.

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:38.470
The terrifying SCP-106, also known as the
Old Man, also got a significant power boost.

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:43.560
He became so intelligent that he was capable
of conversing with Foundation staff - Presumably

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:46.960
just to say nasty things to them as they tortured
them to death.

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:53.230
He was also able to better control his dimensional
portal abilities, making escape far easier.

00:07:53.230 --> 00:07:58.990
Which is bad news for the human race, given
the Old Man’s dark tendencies.

00:07:58.990 --> 00:08:04.220
SCP-294, the coffee machine, got an incredibly
weird upgrade - Now, rather than dispensing

00:08:04.220 --> 00:08:09.070
items that can mess with individuals, it messes
with the global economy via the success or

00:08:09.070 --> 00:08:14.130
failure of the Coca Cola Company, one of the
largest beverage companies in the world.

00:08:14.130 --> 00:08:18.880
Transactions performed on SCP-294 will affect
the global stock price and trading success

00:08:18.880 --> 00:08:22.639
for the company, creating wild economic instability.

00:08:22.639 --> 00:08:28.550
SCP-662, the Butler’s Hand Bell that summons
the delightfully practical butler Mr. Deeds,

00:08:28.550 --> 00:08:31.050
went from convenient to terrifying.

00:08:31.050 --> 00:08:35.740
Any time it was rung, the ringer was brought
to a random, unknown location where they would

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:40.590
be asked to perform a seemingly impossible
task, and then be anomalously compelled to

00:08:40.590 --> 00:08:42.670
complete said task.

00:08:42.670 --> 00:08:45.960
This could lead to debilitating and distressing
injuries.

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:49.029
Now you know how poor Mr. Deeds feels.

00:08:49.029 --> 00:08:54.030
SCP-701, the Hanged King’s Tragedy, was
originally a lethal, cursed play that causes

00:08:54.030 --> 00:08:57.620
madness and death for anyone unlucky enough
to witness it.

00:08:57.620 --> 00:09:04.529
After SCP-001, The Hanged King’s Tragedy
was transformed into a mass-marketed HBO series

00:09:04.529 --> 00:09:07.400
starring Javier Bardem
in the title role.

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:12.070
The show was immediately renewed for five
seasons, meaning it will likely cause horrifying

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:17.560
death and madness for millions across the
globe.

00:09:17.560 --> 00:09:25.010
SCP-993 was a disturbing anomalous children’s
program hosted by the infamous Bobble The

00:09:25.010 --> 00:09:29.390
Clown, who would convince the children in
the audience to commit violent or depraved

00:09:29.390 --> 00:09:30.390
acts.

00:09:30.390 --> 00:09:36.340
Thanks to the SCP-001 boost, Bobble instead
took up an adult news show on cable television,

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:40.960
where he instead exerted his violent influence
over global power players.

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:45.320
His guests have included then-United Kingdom
Foreign Secretary Boris Johnson, Philippine

00:09:45.320 --> 00:09:50.450
President Rodrigo Duterte, Canadian Prime
Minister Justin Trudeau, and National People's

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:54.050
Congress of China Chairman Zhang Dejiang.

00:09:54.050 --> 00:09:59.340
SCP-1981, also known as "RONALD REAGAN CUT
UP WHILE TALKING", was a cursed VHS tape of

00:09:59.340 --> 00:10:04.400
a Ronald Reagan speech that shows the former
president being mutilated and speaking violent

00:10:04.400 --> 00:10:05.400
nonsense.

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:10.140
Naturally, thanks to SCP-001, this obscure
little tape got a serious upgrade.

00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:15.120
It became a series of massively viewed videos
on the video-sharing platform Dailymotion.

00:10:15.120 --> 00:10:20.070
It shows a completely skinned version of Ronald
Reagan, addressing the 2013 meeting of the

00:10:20.070 --> 00:10:22.730
World Economic Forum in Davos, Switzerland.

00:10:22.730 --> 00:10:26.870
Rather than the typical blood and brimstone,
though, the content of each speech consists

00:10:26.870 --> 00:10:32.460
of technical specifications for as-yet-unknown
anomalous technological devices.

00:10:32.460 --> 00:10:37.630
SCP-2006, also known as Too Spooky, was a
shapeshifter with the stated intention of

00:10:37.630 --> 00:10:42.520
causing fear and horror in its subjects, but
it thankfully wasn’t very good at this,

00:10:42.520 --> 00:10:47.200
as the Foundation tricked it into occupying
the forms of stupid B-movie monsters.

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:53.940
However, after the SCP-001 upgrade, it shifted
its goals to causing happiness and contentment.

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:59.460
In order to do this, it took the form of SCP-999,
but without any of its anomalous effects.

00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:05.350
Instead, it absorbed 15 agents, saying “this
is the closest anyone will be to achieving

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:10.360
happiness” as they suffocated within its
inescapable gelatinous mass.

00:11:10.360 --> 00:11:16.220
SCP-2337, also known as Dr. Spanko, was a
sentient and sapient male corncrake who speaks

00:11:16.220 --> 00:11:21.520
bizarre, nonsensical sentences at an incredibly
loud volume, destroying things with the sheer

00:11:21.520 --> 00:11:22.990
sound of its voice.

00:11:22.990 --> 00:11:29.010
However, thanks to the extra power imbued
by SCP-001, Dr. Spanko entered the dream realm.

00:11:29.010 --> 00:11:33.350
He appears to people in their dreams all over
the world, causing considerable distress to

00:11:33.350 --> 00:11:37.170
his victims by speaking to them in his trademark
deafening voice.

00:11:37.170 --> 00:11:42.330
This has caused general anxiety and sleep
deprivation to rise across the human population.

00:11:42.330 --> 00:11:49.480
SCP-2845, also known as The Deer, was terrifyingly
powerful before SCP-001 ever got its hands

00:11:49.480 --> 00:11:50.480
on it.

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:56.540
This monster had almost unparalleled reality-warping
powers, and was only kept contained in Site-100

00:11:56.540 --> 00:12:01.210
by tricking it into believing that the extensive
rituals used to keep it contained were actually

00:12:01.210 --> 00:12:02.210
effective.

00:12:02.210 --> 00:12:07.920
It’s hard to say what specific form the
001 upgrade took on SCP-2845, but we do know

00:12:07.920 --> 00:12:13.240
that shortly after it happened, Site-100 was
lost entirely, and it became impossible to

00:12:13.240 --> 00:12:16.580
contact any personnel who were previously
within.

00:12:16.580 --> 00:12:20.800
And this is just a handful of the countless
anomalies that were turned into dangerous

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:27.399
and terrifying Super-SCPs by SCP-001, leading
what seemed like a coordinated attack not

00:12:27.399 --> 00:12:31.130
just against the Foundation but humanity itself.

00:12:31.130 --> 00:12:36.820
All Foundation resources were directed towards
getting this new SCP-001 situation back under

00:12:36.820 --> 00:12:42.380
control, and that started to stretch the already-dwindling
resources of the besieged Foundation even

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:43.380
thinner.

00:12:43.380 --> 00:12:44.770
Why was this happening?

00:12:44.770 --> 00:12:51.010
Who or what was the mysterious SCP-001, and
what did it hope to achieve by making Earth’s

00:12:51.010 --> 00:12:52.560
anomalies stronger?

00:12:52.560 --> 00:12:56.710
To answer these questions, and have any hope
of stopping this process before it tore the

00:12:56.710 --> 00:13:02.240
world asunder, the SCP Foundation would need
to go to deeper and darker places than they’d

00:13:02.240 --> 00:13:07.450
ever gone before - And reckon with the secrets
in their past, present, and future.

00:13:07.450 --> 00:13:10.649
We’d love to tell you that this is where
the horrors end.

00:13:10.649 --> 00:13:11.910
But stay tuned.

00:13:11.910 --> 00:13:16.500
Because, sadly, this little nightmare is only
the beginning...

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:21.020
Now go check out “SCP-001 - Which is the
Real 001?”

00:13:21.020 --> 00:13:26.060
and “SCP-001 Ouroboros Cycle - The Full
Story Compilation” for more of the endless

00:13:26.060 --> 00:13:29.510
horrors and mysteries of SCP-001!

